+# OpenMW multiplayer test harness
+
+- `server/relay.py` — newline-delimited JSON relay (`--mirror` echoes you back as a ghost 300 units east).
+- `server/bot.py` — fake second player walking in a circle.
+- `mod/` — `mp.omwscripts` + `scripts/mp/global.lua`, a global script using `openmw.net`:
+  streams the player's cell/position/yaw 5x/second and shows each remote player as a `com_chest_01`.
+
+Run: `multiplayer/run-test.sh [path/to/openmw]`, then load a save. Watch `openmw.log` for `[mp]` lines.
+Protocol: one JSON object per line, `{"t":"state","name","cell","pos":[x,y,z],"yaw"}`; the server adds `id`.
